GTK mixed-link test 2: Geany and L3afpad sharing one GTK
=======================================================

A TEST, not a release (riscos-gtk + riscos-crossdev 1.11-test1).

Geany and L3afpad are linked "mixed": UnixLib is inside each program, as
usual, but GTK 3.24.52, riscos-gtk's RISC OS backend and the libraries
under them (GLib, cairo, pango, harfbuzz, FreeType, fontconfig, pixman,
libpng, libjpeg...) are 26 shared libraries in !GTKLibs, loaded by
!SharedLibs (SOManager and ld-riscos/so/2). Both programs use the same
!GTKLibs, so with both running there should be one copy of GTK in
memory, not two.

Sizes of the programs themselves:
  Geany    6.7 MB  (22.6 MB static, RC17)
  L3afpad  0.75 MB (17.2 MB static, RC17)
  !GTKLibs 20.5 MB, shared by both

You need
--------
- RISC OS 5 on ARMv7 or later (Pi 2 or later), 16 or 32 bpp mode
- SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later, ARMEABISupport and Iconv (PackMan),
  as for the normal GTK programs
- the !SharedLibs in this zip (from Iris: SOManager 3.04 with
  ld-riscos/so/2). The older !SharedLibs 4.0 from riscos.info has only
  ld-riscos/so/1 and can't run these; each !Run says so if that one is
  the one booted.

Trying it
---------
1. Unzip it. Ideally restart, then open this folder before anything else
   that runs ELF programs, so the Filer sees this !SharedLibs and
   !GTKLibs first.
2. Run !MemReport: the "before" figures.
3. Double-click !Geany. When its window is open, run !MemReport again.
4. Double-click !L3afpad. When its window is open, run !MemReport again.

!MemReport writes <Wimp$ScrapDir>.MemReport and opens it (each run
replaces it, so copy each one before the next).

What to look at
---------------
- "Shared Libraries" (SOManager's dynamic area): about 20 MB after
  Geany starts. If GTK is shared, it should stay about the same when
  L3afpad starts; if it grows by about 20 MB, it isn't.
- Each program's slot ("geany:", "l3afpad:").
- For comparison, the same with the normal RC17 Geany and L3afpad
  (static): their slots, with both open.
- Each program's Log, <Wimp$ScrapDir>.Geany.Log and .L3afpad.Log: the
  "riscos-gtk: started: ... ready after N s" line.

Files
-----
!GTKLibs      the 26 shared libraries (lib), for every mixed GTK program
!Geany        Geany 2.1, mixed (geany,e1f is the ELF program)
!L3afpad      L3afpad 0.8.18.1.11, mixed (l3afpad,e1f)
!SharedLibs   Iris's !SharedLibs (SOManager 3.04, ld-riscos/so/2)
!MemReport    writes the memory report described above

Geany and L3afpad are GPL 2. The GTK stack is LGPL 2.1 and MIT-style; see
each program's LicenceLGPL and Source. !SharedLibs is GCCSDK's (see its
docs). Built by riscos-gtk's build/build-mixed.sh, branch mixed-link-test.
